<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND ALL OUT FOR 162 IN THIRD TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND ALL OUT FOR 162 IN THIRD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were all out for 162 on the third day of the third cricket test against Australia on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235 (S.Waugh 108; D.Headley 4-72, D.Gough 3-52), England 162 (M.Butcher 51)</p>
